# The sweep's seed puts a stock reader database on the simulated card: a
# Kobo Store book whose file is on the card and one that is not downloaded.
# Both sit on the Kobo reader shelf, and each says where it can be read.
wait-for Kobo reader
tap Kobo reader
wait-for The Lighthouse Keeper
expect A Winter Crossing
expect Not downloaded
shot books-kobo-reader
tap A Winter Crossing
wait-for not downloaded yet
shot books-not-downloaded
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for The Lighthouse Keeper
tap The Lighthouse Keeper
wait-for Kobo Store open in the Kobo reader
shot books-store-book
